  "description": "Lightweight .NET MAUI controls with SkiaSharp drawing. Includes SkiaCalendarView (single/range date selection, month and year pickers), SkiaToggleButton (single/multiple selection, custom Content and alignment), SkiaComboBox (drop-down list and manual entry), SkiaSelectorView (multiple choice with Select all and Clear) and SkiaGalleryView (swipeable images). Toggle and gallery controls also work inside SkiaCollectionView item templates.",
  "id": "SkiaMauiControls",
