  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "NS2Ae+JMYf/USo7NXcCBG16NHXw8azQjt6hPvKPvFl84gLNjcEsMxdOlzvRXdvn0a0NmOAwabzGeuNT28Zw4sw==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 135279,
  "published": "2026-10-18T20:33:54.72Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0-rc.2.8: SkiaToggleButton adds Content (custom MAUI views, with Text/Icon fallback) and HorizontalContentAlignment; it now derives from ContentView and also renders custom content inside SkiaCollectionView templates. SkiaComboBox adds UseIcons, HorizontalAlignment, DoubleTapped and Keyboard; double-tap opens manual entry, matching existing items or storing new text in SelectedItem. Built on SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.8.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.7: built on SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.7 (crash fix for lists inside MAUI's CollectionView).\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.6: UseSkiaMauiControls() also registers SkiaCollectionView's handler (lists drawn by Android's renderer). Built on SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.6.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.5: built on SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.5 (a gallery loading inside a list shows the list's native spinner, which doesn't repaint the list).\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.4: SkiaGalleryView shows a spinner on a page whose picture is still loading and a crossed-out picture when its source gives no image, on a page and inside SkiaCollectionView (where it follows the list's ShowImageLoadingIndicator, ShowImageErrorIndicator and ImageIndicatorColor). Requires SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.4.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.3: built on SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.3.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.2: built on SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.2.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.1: SkiaToggleButton works inside SkiaCollectionView item templates: rows are drawn from their items, a tap writes SelectedValue (or a SkiaToggleGroup container's) into the row's item and runs Command, groups follow, a drag scrolls the list. Requires SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.1.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2: First preview. SkiaCalendarView, SkiaToggleButton, SkiaComboBox, SkiaSelectorView and SkiaGalleryView (swipeable images with page indicators; inside SkiaCollectionView item templates it is baked with the row and comes alive under the finger). Requires .NET 11 / MAUI 11 RC2.",
